SUMMARY:Let’s Lift the Curfew about 4.5k
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Sarah Fowkes\n\nThis is part of ‘Lift the Curfew’ a
 nd ‘This Girl Can’ to raise the profile of issues female runners often 
 face. Wear as much high viz and lights as you can to get us noticed. \nThis
  run is aimed at our current and previous TF fledglings and so we shall wal
 k any hills and do about 4.5k in about 40 to 45 minutes.\nWe shall be very 
 sociable and expect some fun! \nNo one left behind!\nAny questions Sarah (r
 un leader) [Phone Number Redacted]\n\nView on Strava: https://www.strava.co
 m/clubs/208705/group_events/3546549408630764354\n\nSynced from Strava Club 
 208705 on Mon\, 26 Oct @ 5:03 AM
