 e Curfew’ and ‘This Girl Can’ to raise the profile of issues female r
 unners often face. Wear as much high viz and lights as you can to get us no
 ticed. This run is aimed at our current and previous TF fledglings and so w
 e shall walk any hills and do about 4.5k in about 40 to 45 minutes.We shall
  be very sociable and expect some fun! No one left behind!Any questions Sar
 ah (run leader) [Phone Number Redacted]View on Strava: https://www.strava.c
 om/clubs/208705/group_events/3546549408630764354Synced from Strava Club 208
 705 on: Mon\, 26 Oct @ 5:03 AM
LOCATION:Malvern England WR14 United Kingdom
URL:https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/3546549408630764354
